        ],
        [
          585.3495870934667,
          546.5425646816993
        ]
      ],
      "note" : "# Hand Pose Analysis\n\nSimilar to Face Pose Analysis we can output points for each interesting joint in a hand.\n\nHere we use the tip of the thumb and the tip of the index finger, calculate the distance between those points, smooth it, and use that value to drive a pixelation effect, as well as scale geometry to demonstrate the amount visually",
      "id" : "AED17784-BFA3-4F26-8669-8661678C3E8A"
    }
  ],
